Module barrow "A torch-seller with a stuck barrow, and a lane" {
  Place yard "the yard" is room.
  Place lane "the lane" is room.
  Passage gate "the yard gate" is gate between yard and lane.
  Company party "You" of 1 at yard.
  Person halm "Teodor Halm" at yard { Role "a scholar". Peaceable. Pronouns he. Sells torch for 3 coin from 3. }
  Topic barrow with halm "Help Halm free his barrow's wheel" when not grateful(halm, party) {
    Says "The wheel comes up out of the rut with a jolt, and Halm thanks you twice over.".
    On discuss { Assert grateful(halm, party). }
  }
  Initially Set quantity(party, gold) to 5.
  Observe yard_scene at yard when true "A yard, and a scholar selling torches off a barrow.".
  Observe lane_scene at lane when true "A lane between hedges.".
  Goal false.
}
